notificationTemplates.whatsappBody:
🎉 *Congratulations {student_name}!* Welcome to *{institute_name}*!

Your admission is confirmed for *{course_name}*.

📌 *Student ID:* {student_id}
📌 *Batch:* {batch_number}
📌 *Learning Mode:* Practical Lab & Online
📌 *Helpline:* {helpline}

📲 Access your student portal for class schedules, digital ID card & receipts: {portal_url}

_We look forward to accelerating your tech career!_

🧾 *Official Payment Receipt - {institute_name}*

Dear *{student_name}*,
We have successfully received your course fee payment.

💵 *Amount Paid:* BDT {paid_amount}
📄 *Money Receipt No:* {receipt_no}
📚 *Course:* {course_name}
⏳ *Remaining Due:* BDT {due_amount}

📥 Download/Print your digital money receipt anytime from the Student Portal: {portal_url}

Helpline: {helpline}

⚠️ *Course Fee Installment Reminder*

Dear *{student_name}* (ID: {student_id}),

This is a gentle reminder that your scheduled installment fee of *BDT {due_amount}* for *{course_name}* is pending.

Please clear the balance at the academy accounts desk or via bKash/Nagad merchant to avoid any disruption to your exam admit card.

📞 Accounts Desk: {helpline}
🌐 Student Portal: {portal_url}

📢 *Class Schedule & Meeting Alert*

Dear *{student_name}*,

Your upcoming class for *{course_name}* (*{batch_number}*) is scheduled:

⏰ *Time:* {class_time}
🏢 *Room/Lab:* {room_no}
🔗 *Live Meeting Link:* {meeting_url}

Please join 5 minutes early with your lab assignments ready.

_{institute_name}_
